WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.490
My name is Kurata Sana,
first year Junior High student.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.280
The strange white bat, Babbit!

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.870
Lapa means trumpet in Chinese.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.870
I think "Lapa" is a Chinese phrase.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:45.460
The friend I trust most in New York, Naozumi-kun.

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:50.380
The First and Last
Mother-Son Battle

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.630
It can't be.

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:59.140
Wait a minute!
What's up with you guys?

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.430
Hey!

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:01.800
Wait!

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.310
Fine, be that way!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:09.230
There'll be plenty of people to take your place!

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.190
Plenty!

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:15.030
M-my...

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.030
My dream has...

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.910
Please come with me!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.530
Please!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.410
Naozumi-kun.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.000
Are you coming then, Naozumi?

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:37.760
Tomorrow is opening night,
I'd like to prepare myself.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.720
I'll stay at the theater tonight.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.010
What?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.930
I'll go with you.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.810
Sana-chan!
You're making rash decisions again.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:47.810
But Yuko, she...

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.940
Hello?

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:51.520
Yes, that's right.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.230
Sensei!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:56.030
I see, I guess it was wrong of me to ask you.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.530
All the best on your stage show.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.620
Don't catch cold.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.500
Thank you!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.000
Well then, we're off!

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.630
We'll just leave the rest to you.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.630
Wait, Sana-chan!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.510
Sana-chan! Sensei says she's coming tomorrow morning.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.430
Please tell Mama sorry for me!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.180
Sana-chan, you don't have to go with me.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.810
Ah, don't worry about it.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.930
We're as close as skin and clock now!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.730
You mean we're partners, right?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.100
I'll follow your lead.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:33.770
High five!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.940
The last self-rehearsal

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.980
What a strong friendship!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.210
Alright, alright, alright.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.000
Stop! Stop!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.840
Absolutely no good.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.630
Absolutely no good?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.510
What are you thinking?

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.140
Are you trying to be first-class dancers?

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:13.060
Gary Hamilton invited you here not to see you
dance the way the other dancers do.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:18.020
It was to see Sana Kurata
and Naozumi Kamura dance.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.240
Your dance is done.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.030
Don't use up all your energy.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.410
I won't allow you to rehearse anymore.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.030
Just let your brains be blank.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.540
Now go home and go to bed.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.630
"Let your brains be blank".

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.000
What should we do?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.710
Let's go.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.220
Stop, Yuko!

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.170
Yuko!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.970
Let go of me, leave me alone!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:48.100
I have no talent, no nothing.
It doesn't matter what happens to me!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.390
How can I leave you?
You're my lover, I love you.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.640
Why, why can you say "I love you"?

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.110
Don't you look down on me, thinking that
I'm a woman who uses children!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.270
Yuko!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:03.030
Well, you only have me, right?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:08.490
So let's go to the country and live a quiet life.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.120
No, I don't want to.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.330
Yuko.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.840
Yuko.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.130
Uh, we did knock though.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.640
Hmph, are you here to laugh at me?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.100
I came to laugh at you.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.810
What's strange about that?

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:42.940
You hurt me so many times and the dream you keep chasing disappeared in a flash.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.030
How can I help but laugh?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.530
Why you!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.290
The woman who deserted me twice is now down and out. It feels great!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.580
How can you say this to your own mother?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.410
Ha, you should talk.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.330
Ah, that felt good.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.630
Sana-chan, let's go.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.710
Uh, ok ok.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.630
What a pity, Naozumi.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.300
You are my son after all.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:11.680
That's why you'll never have any talent. Because you are my son.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.020
You're fated to fail also.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:18.730
You'll only embarrass yourself in the limelight.
Go on crying back to Japan.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.100
Hey, that's a bit too much.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.230
Whether or not I'm your son

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.110
I'll prove it to you on stage.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.820
Are you brave enough to come?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.530
Huh, I don't need to be brave, Naozumi.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:32.830
I'm not going.
I'm not about to waste my time.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.620
You're weak, cowardly, useless...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.330
Say whatever you like.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.210
Alright, get out, get out.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.960
Go home, go home

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.920
Too scary.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.340
Naozumi-kun, are you still awake?

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.180
She's such a reckless woman.
It makes me so mad.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.100
Yeah, she's really horrible.
How can there be someone like that?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.230
But...

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.600
But?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.230
Maybe you wouldn't understand this.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.020
But really...

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:08.320
Even though that's how she really is...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.530
I like it.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:15.910
Compared to the fake, gentle face she had...

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:21.830
I like this natural face of hers better.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:26.000
Well, I'm not too clear about it,
but I guess I can understand.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.600
They're leaving!
The audience is leaving!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.400
It's my fault! My fault!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.520
No, it's not, Naozumi-kun!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.030
How embarassing for you,
you've failed, haven't you?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:52.030
You really have no talent.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.110
That's not true!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.820
That's definately not true!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.410
You idiot!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.870
What kind of dream was that?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.430
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.970
Good morning.
Your trumpet sounds good.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.230
Yeah, it's because my mind's all blank.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:24.810
Really? No wonder, that's great!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.070
- Today's finally here.
- Yeah.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.740
I must make it a success.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.740
It will be.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.910
Right, it must be.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.530
Do you think Yuko-san will come?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:42.080
It doesn't matter, today I'm
standing on stage for myself.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.620
You're crisp as a radish chip today.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.330
Guess so.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:51.840
Do you remember what you
said when we first arrived?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.510
What was it?

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:57.010
Let's do our best together.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.220
Yeah, I did say that.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.600
If we're together, we can do our best.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:08.020
But you know, at the time I didn't
think so many things would happen.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:12.400
I've been able to keep doing my
best because you've been there.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.490
Because you've been here,
I've been doing my best.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.110
Me too.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:21.120
Since really, there's just the two of us here.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.620
Just the two of us.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.000
Naozumi-kun, let's hear one more!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.430
Rick, Rick!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.430
Hurry and get up, we're going.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.440
- Going? Where to?
- Mexico, Mexico.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.940
You said you were taking me to the countryside.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.320
I'm tired of this city New York that won't recognize me.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.240
Hurry up and get ready!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.330
Huh? Eh? Huh? Ramsy...

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:06.830
Shimura-san!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.710
Sana-chan!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.130
Have you been well?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.420
Yeah, great! When did you get here?

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.340
Just now.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.210
Where's Mama?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.420
Gone sight-seeing with Bernadette-san.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.300
That was quick.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.430
They hit it off right when they met.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.720
I'm Kurata Misako.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.520
I'm Bernadette Pink.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.730
Shake hands.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.520
Let's go sight-seeing.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.530
Sensei! But your promised you'd start writing as soon as you arrived.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.240
You're too silly, this is New York!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.740
What's that got to do with it?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.410
Hyaa! Silver!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.910
Misako's awesome.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.320
Sensei, stop!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.330
Sensei's gone sight-seeing

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.620
Let's not worry about Sensei.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.620
Here, have a taste of Japan.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.000
Let's eat!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.840
There's tea too.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.920
What's wrong, Naozumi-kun?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.720
There's Mentaiko in this.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.930
Oh my, you don't like Mentaiko?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.640
Naozumi doesn't like anything too spicy.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.430
Cause he's still got a little kid's taste.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.520
He doesn't have an adult's taste.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.100
Quit yakking already.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.310
It's okay.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:12.730
Here, this is Okaka, why don't you eat this.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.240
The rice balls have Mentaiko in them, sorry!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.240
Hurry up, I'm leaving.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.030
But there's more luggage.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:23.200
Just leave it!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.780
H-hey! Hey wait! Wait!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.200
The Show's
about to start

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:26.910
So...!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.840
Naozumi!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.720
Maeda-san! Why are you here?
You're supposed to be in the hospital.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.930
It's my dear Naozumi's opening
day, how could I not come?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.810
- I snuck out.
- Is that alright?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.810
I wish - my body hurts!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.810
Please be careful, you're getting old.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.600
Don't say that!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.400
What about you, how are you doing?

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:58.230
Don't worry,
I've done everything that I need to.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.400
Oh, you... you....

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.030
Oof, Maeda-san, this really hurts!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.200
Naozumi-kun, are you ready?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.410
Oops! Sorry to interrupt.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.530
It's not like that.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.200
What are you doing?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.330
How are your injuries?

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.120
Naozumi's growth makes me so happy.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.630
Maeda-san, I understand how you feel,
but leave everything here to me.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.000
Why don't you go back to the hospital?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.420
I'm tired of the hospital.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.800
It's finally here.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.800
Yeah, finally.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.430
Don't be nervous.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.930
You too.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:37.820
You invited child stars from Japan for
this musical, wasn't it a gamble?

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.400
Don't worry, this performance will be a success.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.900
I've just confirmed it.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:44.990
Just?

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.700
Broadway standards must be pretty far above theirs.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.620
No, there is no difference in
their ability to move an audience.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.410
So he's Gary Hamilton.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.210
Yes, Nao's...

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.330
So, enjoy the show.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:08.300
Wow, Broadway really is different.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.600
You're about to go on stage yourself,
this isn't the time to be wowed.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:15.520
The size of the stage in my dream last
night was the same as the one at school.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.310
You dreamed about it?
You must've been pretty nervous.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.530
Yeah. I dreamed I fell on stage and
then jumped around by myself.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:27.820
But you blamed yourself for it
and yelled loudly "I failed!"

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.200
Eh? Naozumi-kun?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.540
Sana-chan...

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.620
I can't move.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.830
Naozumi-kun.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:48.890
{parte b}

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.440
So you're not going to watch Naozumi's performance.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.810
Shut up.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.110
Is that okay?

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.740
It is your son's performance.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.530
I said shut up.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.030
Mexican Taco.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.540
On the other hand.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.540
What's going on?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.130
Oh no, I'm very afraid.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.500
You're kidding, right?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.210
It's almost time for us.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.720
Damn it!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.930
You are my son after all.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.430
You'll never have talent.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.300
Because you are my son.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.600
In the end you'll fail too.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.600
I'm her son.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:41.440
Damn it, I'm her son.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:46.240
Oh no, I shouldn't have mentioned the dream.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.900
Sana-chan, I'm sorry, but I can't.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.240
Naozumi-kun.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.510
Can you feel it?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.720
...my thumping heart.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.770
We're together all along.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.310
You and I are together.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.530
Haven't we been together this entire time?

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.820
Sana-chan.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.530
Just think about me now.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.530
Only about me.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:45.500
See, we're twin angels.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.920
Twin angels.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.430
So what if it's Broadway?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.310
It's just a giant school concert.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.810
Giant School Concert?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.520
How arrogant.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.240
Why haven't you said anything since then?

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.240
Didn't you tell me to shut up?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.910
God.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.250
God, shut up already!

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.800
It'll be the next scene, Misako.
I'm so excited.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.140
Misako?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.140
She's going to the restroom.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:39.600
Oh.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.520
Once she gets excited she keeps
running to the restroom.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.310
No, I'm not.
I'm going to buy some popcorn.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.810
Sensei doesn't get excited.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.530
Yuko.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.920
There's nobody here.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:13.010
Why don't we help them?

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.300
Erk, they've started!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.020
They're great!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:47.930
Yuko!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.100
This is terrible.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:54.730
If this continues, Naozumi
Kamura won't be able to go on.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.650
What?

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:58.950
Unable... Unable...

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.900
That is a strange thing to say,
I must take note.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.550
So how was it? What are your thoughts on your first performance?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:22.800
You first, Kurata.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.220
Oh, I was too serious up there, I'm not too sure myself.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.600
We couldn't tell at all, that was a great performance.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.810
Really? I just pretended it was a big school concert.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:32.940
School concert?

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.110
Uh, no, nevermind.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.400
It's a good thing Bernie's here.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.030
This is a bit too heavy for my head.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.700
Yeah, was it that necessary?

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.530
And Naozumi Kamura, how about you?

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.540
Um, uh, I feel the same.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.130
Excuse me...

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.310
Not bad.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.360
Let's go, Rick!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.820
Huh? Okay.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.230
Goodbye, Mother.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.210
Cheers!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.920
Aah, how wonderful,
opening night was a success.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.930
Yeah, Sana-chan was awesome.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.140
Nao was awesome too.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.930
Sana-chan was more awesome.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.020
Naozumi was more awesome.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:38.770
They're both awesome!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:39.150
Maeda-san snuck out of the hospital again, geez.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.440
Really, you've both worked really hard.

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.690
Thank you. We couldn't have done it without your help.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.070
What are you talking about?
It was done with your own strength.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.620
No, we really do have to thank you.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:54.540
Oh right, news on Broadway's
new stars might be on TV.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.830
We're going to be on American TV?

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.000
Well, you both did great and deserve some praise.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.420
Hearing Mama say that makes me feel kind of shy.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.630
It's Gary-san!
This is Hamilton-san.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:13.060
So rumor has it that the Japanese child
star Naozumi Kamura is your son.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:14.560
Is that true?

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:15.930
Yes, it's true.

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:18.730
Naozumi Kamura is my son.

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:24.820
Gary!

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:31.410
He... said... it.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:40.040
matte  mou wakaretai no yo

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:40.040
"Wait... I want us to split up", I said

