Yeah!

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.220
What's going to happen in the next episode of Kodocha?

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:12.430
Yuko-san left after that.

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:13.930
I guess to live her own life.

00:24:13.930 --> 00:24:17.640
Naozumi-kun will probably never see her again.

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:22.020
The silly dad, Gary, who's so different from Yuko-san.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.310
From a king producer he became a silly dad.

